Deeply concerned by the illicit trafficking of arms and ammunition into Haiti, which continues to fuel gang violence, and stressing the importance of full implementation of the sanctions measures imposed by resolutions 2699 (2023), 2700 (2023) and 2752 (2024), and of international and regional cooperation to disrupt trafficking networks,

